WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.5 · Brand, Identity & Image
Visual identity

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A simple visual system, used everywhere, makes you recognisable, accessible and respectful.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Define logo versions, two or three colours, one typeface.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check text contrast before choosing colour pairs.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Show people only with informed consent.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita Weavers: deep red and gold, a shuttle mark, true-colour photos, each weaver named only with her consent.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your visual elements, imagery rules and accessibility checks.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
